# API routes

## Auth

- User routes: require session; scope all queries by `session.user.id`
- Admin routes: check admin via `ADMIN_EMAILS` / role helper in `src/lib/auth.ts`
- Unauthenticated: `{ ok: false, error: "Unauthorized" }` with HTTP 401
- Forbidden admin: HTTP 403

## Response shape

Use helpers from `src/lib/api.ts`:

```typescript
return apiSuccess({ ok: true, ...data });
return apiError('message', 400);
```

Prefer `{ ok: boolean, error?: string }` — consistent with existing routes.

## Rate limits

In-memory per-user limits in `src/config/constants.ts`. Only reliable on single instance (PM2 fork, instances=1).

## Validation

- Validate request body/query with Zod or shared validators in `src/lib/`
- Return 400 with clear Vietnamese or English error messages matching existing routes
